      "text": "First study to propose an automated feature engineering and metalearning pipeline for ncRNA sequences in bacteria;    BioAutoML can be applied in multi-class and binary problems;    BioAutoML can be used in other DNA/RNA sequences scenarios;    BioAutoML can accelerate new studies, reducing the feature engineering time-consuming stage and improving the design and performance of ML pipelines in bioinformatics;   BioAutoML does not require specialist human assistance.",
